NOTE ON THE BUNDLED SCRIPTURE

The Ardaas texts in Ardaas/Resources/ are traditional Sikh liturgy and are not
subject to this or any copyright. They are included so that anyone can verify
what the app recites. Their sources are cited in each file's `sources` array
and surfaced in the app's About & Sources screen.

Roman transliterations of the Buddha Dal text and of the occasion list are
generated by GurmukhiTransliterator (this repository) and pinned to it by
tests. The SGPC variant's transliteration and English are human-authored from
the cited sources.
